<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 28.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 28.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by KUKU Raadio on Wednesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- The Meat Union supports customs tariffs on meat products.</p>
<p>- The United States and the European Union celebrate the 50th anniversary of the Marshall Plan.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
